#NEXUS

[ turner2007b_fig5: Coelurosaurian strict consensus. Dromaeosauridae (the node dot) is the internal label. Node lines were listed from the image pixels and checked against the figure; the boxed dromaeosaurid polytomy and the unenlagiine clade were read by eye because the box frame joins their lines in the pixel listing. 58 tips, 6 polytomies (3, 3, 3, 8, 3, 11 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

